      "evidence": "template/.github/workflows/process-health-labels.yml.jinja: `curl -fsS -H \"$AUTH\" \"https://api.github.com/repos/${REPOSITORY}/labels/process%3Amanaged\"`. This matters only for a GitHub Enterprise Server project with scm_provider=github. The change removes the `gh` dependency for every runner kind, not only self-hosted ones.",
